<title>HONG KONG: Chung Hwa interim profit rises 39.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Chung Hwa interim profit rises 39.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.87  vs 1.49 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    17.52 vs 12.57</p>
<p>    Turnover		     96.89 vs 86.42</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chung Hwa Development Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong-based packager Chung Hwa Development was formerly Rich City Packaging Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Share earnings adjusted for two bonus shares issues of seven shares for every eight shares held which made in October 1995 and a bonus issue of four shares for every five shares held which made in September 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
